robots/
test/
test-tools/
tests/
hacktests/
# NOTE: robots/ corpus seeds must be provided by the user before first run.
# the robots/ dir is recommended to contain a wikitext-103-all.txt file,which is from wikitext
# the robots/ dir's file is all seen as input during the training process of tiny transformer model,which serve the context module.
# the  hacktests folder provide the input for security module.It is a must for the running of security module.
# The patterns above only exclude generated/binary/runtime content.
